      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045923">FMA</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045925">Multiply scalar single precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm2, subtract xmm3/m32 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1045927">VEX.LIG.66.0F38.W0 BB /r </para>
      <para unique="1045928">VFMSUB231SS xmm1, xmm2, xmm3/m32</para>
