      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045938">Multiply scalar single precision floating-point value from xmm2 and xmm3/m32, subtract xmm1 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046478">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W0 9B /r </para>
      <para unique="1046479">VFMSUB132SS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m32{er}</para>
